cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and also cite Voro++ (Rycroft, 2009)."
type: software
title: "Voronoi3D for ParaView: 3D (weighted) centroidal Voronoi tessellation plugin"
abstract: "Voronoi3D is an open-source ParaView plugin that generates three-dimensional Voronoi tessellations of a box domain, from random seeds or from the points of any dataset, and returns the cells as polyhedral unstructured grids. Lloyd iterations produce centroidal Voronoi tessellations; a density-weighted variant with fixed anchor points grades the cell size around user-defined locations. A native C++ engine based on Voro++ (serial and OpenMP) computes the cells."
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
